usage-azureopenai-setting-api-key = Azure OpenAI 资源密钥：在 Azure 门户中打开 Azure OpenAI 资源，进入 Resource Management > Keys and Endpoint，复制 KEY 1。
usage-azureopenai-setting-endpoint = 同一 Keys and Endpoint 页面上的资源端点，例如 https://my-resource.openai.azure.com。仅接受 HTTPS。
usage-azureopenai-setting-deployment = 要检查的部署名称，即 Azure AI Foundry（https://ai.azure.com）中 Deployments 下列出的名称，例如 chat-prod。
usage-azureopenai-setting-api-version = 可选。"v1" 表示兼容 OpenAI 的 v1 API，也可填写带日期的 API 版本。默认为 2024-10-21。

usage-azureopenai-deployment-plan = 部署：{ $deployment }
usage-azureopenai-reachable = 部署可访问
usage-azureopenai-resource = 资源
usage-azureopenai-deployment = 部署
usage-azureopenai-model = 模型
usage-azureopenai-api-version = API 版本
